      "created_at": "2018-06-18T02:06:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It would be great to see you there next year, lynkfox! It's been a while!  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=9\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\">  (And yeah, I decided I was annoyed enough at not being able to go this year that I'm planning to go next year.) </p>\n<p>But yeah, kids are definitely a good reason not to make it.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/+1.png?v=9\" title=\":+1:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":+1:\">  (Mind you, I don't think there's a <strong><em>bad </em></strong>reason not to make it – there are just reasons.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> )</p>",
