      "raw": "It would be great to see you there next year, lynkfox! It&#39;s been a while!&nbsp; :grin: &nbsp;(And yeah, I decided I was annoyed enough at not being able to go this year that I&#39;m planning to go next year.)&nbsp;\n\nBut yeah, kids are definitely a good reason not to make it.&nbsp; :+1: &nbsp;(Mind you, I don&#39;t think there&#39;s a&nbsp;<strong><em>bad&nbsp;</em></strong>reason not to make it -- there are just reasons.&nbsp; :wink: )",
